{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S03、S11、S12等短段仍有感受提示过密的问题，切换较快时容易让观众忙着追字，X的短词更容易一眼扫完。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】突出每段叙事的关键，让人不必读完整句话就能抓住人物当下的处境；话与感受交替出现，也更容易把人物的念头和音乐中的变化对应起来。尤其是对节奏、音型、力度变化和情绪转折的描写，Y比X具体得多，而且把怀念、孤单、不甘和逐渐接纳自己的过程连成了一条线。虽然局部信息偏密，但实际听下来，Y提供的理解和感受都更充分。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0a1e9dc8-a998-40d1-a491-78d2a58b8c21", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T022501526009Z", "elapsed_seconds": 96.468, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T02:26:38.018207+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5c5b95d6cd68ad8fc3968dd1d1fd5c5f388e373978bdab550be554a6d73db08f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py"